  "dcterms:description": "This repository named 'qm9' is an essentially unmodified copy of the biobricks-ai brick-template. Its download stage (stages/01_download.sh) has an EMPTY ftp base address (ftpbase=\"\"), its dvc.lock records no stages, its README is the generic template 'How to build bricks' text, and there is no .bb metadata or built brick data. No upstream source URL is configured, so it cannot be confirmed from the repository which dataset (if any) it would contain. The name implies the canonical QM9 quantum-chemistry dataset (Ramakrishnan et al. 2014), which is published CC0 on figshare, but that identity is NOT established by anything in this repo.",
