  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude Opus 4.8). This 'qm9' repo is an unconfigured brick-template stub: the download script has an empty ftpbase, dvc.lock has no stages, the README is the generic template, and there is no .bb metadata or built data. Nothing in the repo identifies an upstream dataset or license, so honestly license=UNSTATED, class=unknown, merckCommercialUse=unknown. NOTE: the sibling brick 'qm9-molecular-properties-dataset' IS a working build of the canonical QM9 dataset (figshare article 1057646, CC0) -- if this stub is intended to be the same QM9 data it would be CC0/open, but that cannot be asserted from this repo as it stands. REVIEWER: either point this repo at a real source and re-annotate, or retire it as an empty template.",
